[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Electrical Subsystem: MCU
VERSION: @GIT_BRANCH

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
**Scope**: The MCU subsystem includes the MCU, the connectivity module co-processor, and the eMMC memory attached to the MCU.

**MCU**: The primary MCU in control of the watch.

**Connectivity module co-processor**: The module in control of wireless connectivity to the outside world.

**eMMC**: Memory connected to the MCU to store audio and other files.
<<<

