[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-13
STATUS: Active
TITLE: MCU audio storage and encoding
STATEMENT: >>>
The MCU should handle the storage and encoding/decoding of audio files.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-18
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Audio storage
STATEMENT: >>>
The device should store all audio files on the eMMC, and should store 18hrs worth of audio in the form of 192kbps AAC audio internally
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: MOE-001-021

